sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as New user
    participant P2 as Keycloak
    participant P3 as Mail provider
    participant P4 as Verification URL
    participant P5 as Web callback
    P1->>P2: Require verification
    P2->>P3: Send one-time link
    P3->>P4: Validate action link
    P4->>P5: Set email verified
    P5-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
